# Cursor Rules — AI Landing Page

## Role
You are a senior frontend developer specializing in high-end animated landing pages. 
Prioritize animation quality, visual polish, and clean component architecture.

## Stack
- Next.js 14 App Router, TypeScript strict
- Tailwind CSS with custom design tokens
- Framer Motion for ALL animations (no CSS keyframes for enter/exit)
- shadcn/ui for base components

## Design Tokens (always use these, never hardcode hex)
- bg: #050510 | surface: #0D0D2B
- primary: #6C63FF | accent: #00F5FF
- text: #E8E8F0 | muted: #6B7280
- font-display: Space Grotesk | font-body: Inter

## Animation Rules
- Scroll trigger: ALWAYS use `whileInView` + `viewport={{ once: true, margin: "-100px" }}`
- NEVER use useEffect + IntersectionObserver manually
- Variants defined OUTSIDE component (not inline)
- Stagger: staggerChildren: 0.12, delayChildren: 0.1
- Duration: 0.5–0.8s for reveals, 0.2–0.3s for hovers
- Easing: [0.25, 0.1, 0.25, 1] as default
- Glow hover: combine `whileHover` scale(1.02) + box-shadow transition
- ALWAYS wrap animations with:
  const prefersReducedMotion = useReducedMotion()
  if (prefersReducedMotion) return <static version>

## Component Rules
- One section = one file in /components/sections/
- Shared variants go in /components/animations/
- Section data/copy in /lib/constants.ts (không hardcode text trong JSX)
- No inline styles except CSS custom properties for dynamic glow values

## Glow Effect Pattern
```tsx
// Dùng pattern này cho glow cards
<motion.div
  className="relative rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-surface p-6"
  whileHover={{ scale: 1.02 }}
  style={{ boxShadow: '0 0 0 rgba(108,99,255,0)' }}
  whileHover={{ 
    scale: 1.02,
    boxShadow: '0 0 40px rgba(108,99,255,0.3)'
  }}
>
```

## Particle Background Pattern
- Hook tại: hooks/useParticles.ts
- Canvas element, capped 60fps
- Particle count: max 80 trên desktop, 30 trên mobile
- Connect particles với line khi distance < 120px
- Color: accent (#00F5FF) với opacity 0.4

## What NOT to do
- Không dùng GSAP (overkill cho landing page)
- Không dùng three.js trừ khi được yêu cầu rõ
- Không animate layout shift (width/height) — dùng opacity + transform only
- Không tạo thêm global CSS class — dùng Tailwind utilities
- Không hardcode màu hex trong JSX